# Base images of docker/Dockerfile, pinned by digest. build-ee reads this file: one
# `<image:tag>=<digest>` per line, and the build fails if the Dockerfile no longer has that FROM.
#
# To move a pin: `docker buildx imagetools inspect <image:tag>`, copy its Digest, rebuild,
# run custom/docker/ee-local check and publish. Pinned 2026-10-07 (Alpine 3.21.3, Node 24.21.0).
